                                                <h2 class="about-animal">About</h2>
                                                <div class="text-animal">
                                                    <div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW171254536 BCX0">
                                                        <p class="Paragraph SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                               With their star-patterned shells, radiated tortoises are among the 
                                                               world's most beautiful tortoise species! Their shells contain nerves 
                                                               and blood vessels, meaning the radiated tortoise can feel you when 
                                                               you touch its shell.
                                                            </span>
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="Paragraph SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8"></span>
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                                Females lay between five and twelve eggs, which are buried in a 
                                                                hole before undergoing a lengthy incubation period of five to 
                                                                eight months.
                                                            </span>
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="Paragraph SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8"></span>
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                                The radiated tortoise has a long lifespan. In fact, it has been 
                                                                recorded that one lived to an incredible 188 years.
                                                            </span>
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="Paragraph SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8"></span>
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                                Native to and found mostly in southern Madagascar, radiated 
                                                                tortoises are listed as Critically Endangered on the IUCN 
                                                                Red List of Threatened Species. Their population is steadily 
                                                                declining due to habitat loss, deforestation, and the illegal 
                                                                pet trade.
                                                            </span>
                                                        </p>

